object ObservationsTab: TTabItem
Text = 'Runtime observations'
object ObservationsPurpose: TLabel
Align = Top
Height = 90
WordWrap = True
Text = 'Import a saved UTF-8 .txt, .log or .json extract (up to 256 KiB). Enter its named contributor and actual run/environment description. The current Explorer selection becomes an optional object link. Saved records remain unverified claims; DPH does not execute the program, verify timestamps or infer causal order. Refresh displays the newest 50. Records are stored locally with the database and included in explicit database backups; they are not automatically published.'
end
